data: {"id": "be54bd10b4d54c78-thinking-parallel_evidence-2467", "run_id": "be54bd10b4d54c78", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突和缺口如下：\n\n**1. Pod 身份与生命周期状态**\n*   **身份确认：** Pod `workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c` 运行在 `node2` (10.2.0.50) 上，IP 为 172.16.104.17，UID 为 `20db72b2-f223-4295-8f2d-62edd54cf1cd`，归属 ReplicaSet `workload-7679bcf76`。\n*   **当前状态冲突：** `kubectl_describe` 明确显示 Pod 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态，Kubelet 正在不断重启该 Pod (`Back-off restarting failed container`)。然而，Prometheus 指标 `kube_pod_container_status_phase` 返回 `Running`。这表明在指标查询的瞬间 Pod 可能处于启动窗口期，但 `kubectl` 状态和 `last_terminated_reason` 的长期事实更支持其正处于反复崩溃重启的异常循环中。\n\n**2.", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788442132581, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

